module System

# Each declaration below creates nothing: `@rv` names the shared declaration it shows, and validate-stdlib
# checks that the two still match.

### Represents the aggregate protocol for modulo-width arithmetic.
### `WrappingArithmetic` groups the arithmetic operators that deliberately keep
### only the low bits that fit in the conforming type when overflow occurs.
@rv("WrappingArithmetic")
protocol WrappingArithmetic
obeys WrappingAddable, WrappingSubtractable, WrappingMultiplicable, WrappingExponentiable
